From d8a785563cdb2ceb7ad2cf7bb581dbb9d406a7e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 12:33:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add allowances, entry-mode profiles and team mass entry

Three changes to the prototype, from the specification increment:

- Allowances against a project: wage type catalogue with unit and
  mandatory fields, recorded as quantity, valued by payroll. The
  project bonus is the exception, carries an amount and is recorded
  only by the project owner.
- Entry mode per company: the company comes from IT0001 and
  ZTIME_COMPANY_CFG maps it to a CATS data entry profile, read at the
  date of the entry. Z_CONS records duration, Z_BSRV records BEGUZ and
  ENDUZ with the duration computed.
- Team leader mass entry: hierarchy and project scopes, partial save
  with per-line reasons, CREATED_BY and ON_BEHALF_OF on every line.

Also adds monthly period control per company, and extends the CATS
mapping and payload with LGART, ANZHL, BEGUZ, ENDUZ and the customer
field carrying the bonus amount.

